order_book_cli: 'aapl' is not a symbol (1 to 8 of A-Z, 0-9, '.', '-')
usage: order_book_cli replay <file.csv> [--trades] [--events] [--book] [--validate none|final|per-command]
                                        [--symbol SYM] [--no-statistics]
       order_book_cli demo
       order_book_cli --help
